23:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body ","children":[["$","section","0-What the preliminary match cannot decide",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the preliminary match cannot decide"}],[["$","p","Many scholarships apply conditions that cannot be reduced to one public filter. These can include citizenship, residence, age, graduation date, subject background, work experience, leadership evidence, a university offer, employer permission or nomination by a school or government partner.",{"children":"Many scholarships apply conditions that cannot be reduced to one public filter. These can include citizenship, residence, age, graduation date, subject background, work experience, leadership evidence, a university offer, employer permission or nomination by a school or government partner."}],["$","p","Read the newest official call and course page before preparing documents. If a rule is unclear, ask the programme owner or university in writing rather than relying on an old blog or social-media post.",{"children":"Read the newest official call and course page before preparing documents. If a rule is unclear, ask the programme owner or university in writing rather than relying on an old blog or social-media post."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","1-Build a balanced scholarship shortlist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a balanced scholarship shortlist"}],[["$","p","Create three groups: strong fit, possible fit and aspirational. A strong-fit award should satisfy every known mandatory rule. A possible fit needs one clarification. An aspirational choice can be highly competitive but should still meet the basic eligibility conditions.",{"children":"Create three groups: strong fit, possible fit and aspirational. A strong-fit award should satisfy every known mandatory rule. A possible fit needs one clarification. An aspirational choice can be highly competitive but should still meet the basic eligibility conditions."}],["$","p","Spread applications across different selection models and destinations. This reduces dependence on one scholarship and helps you reuse verified documents while tailoring programme-specific answers.",{"children":"Spread applications across different selection models and destinations. This reduces dependence on one scholarship and helps you reuse verified documents while tailoring programme-specific answers."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}]
